of twenty thousand five hundred dollars a

292
00:10:38,809 --> 00:10:40,924
year and one hundred thousand dollars in

293
00:10:40,924 --> 00:10:41,947
total.

294
00:10:42,047 --> 00:10:44,257
Parents face new limits too.

295
00:10:44,527 --> 00:10:46,978
And a new Repayment Assistance Plan takes

296
00:10:46,978 --> 00:10:49,621
effect by July twenty twenty-six.

297
00:10:49,884 --> 00:10:52,354
Let me put the business together.

298
00:10:52,534 --> 00:10:54,634
Colleges set the price.

299
00:10:54,674 --> 00:10:55,937
The government lends,

300
00:10:55,937 --> 00:10:58,464
and ended up carrying the losses.

301
00:10:58,534 --> 00:10:59,922
Servicers collect,

302
00:10:59,922 --> 00:11:01,934
paid by the borrower.

303
00:11:02,194 --> 00:11:04,417
And the borrowers carry the debt for

304
00:11:04,417 --> 00:11:05,684
decades.

305
00:11:05,804 --> 00:11:07,704
The new limits cap how much flows

306
00:11:07,704 --> 00:11:09,254
in at the top.

307
00:11:09,524 --> 00:11:11,744
Whether that pushes colleges to cut

308
00:11:11,744 --> 00:11:12,388
prices,

309
00:11:12,388 --> 00:11:15,030
or pushes students toward private lenders,

310
00:11:15,030 --> 00:11:17,628
is the question of the next decade.

311
00:11:17,884 --> 00:11:21,085
So what is the business behind America's

312
00:11:21,085 --> 00:11:22,424
student debt?

313
00:11:22,614 --> 00:11:25,474
It was built on a simple promise.

314
00:11:25,564 --> 00:11:26,994
Borrow today,

315
00:11:26,994 --> 00:11:29,054
