316
00:11:29,434 --> 00:11:30,909
For many graduates,

317
00:11:30,909 --> 00:11:32,364
that promise holds.

318
00:11:32,584 --> 00:11:34,724
But the bill has quietly been split

319
00:11:34,724 --> 00:11:36,035
between students,

320
00:11:36,035 --> 00:11:37,078
their parents,

321
00:11:37,078 --> 00:11:38,121
and taxpayers,

322
00:11:38,121 --> 00:11:40,796
while the money for the degree was

323
00:11:40,796 --> 00:11:42,466
paid on day one.

324
00:11:42,717 --> 00:11:44,911
Next time on The Hidden Economics,

325
